          <div class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
          <blockquote class="quote__text">Sleep score went from 68 to 84 on average within two weeks. Not claiming causation, but I'm not stopping either.</blockquote>
          <figcaption class="quote__who">
            <span class="quote__avatar">O</span>
            <span><span class="quote__name">Owen B.</span><br><span class="quote__meta">Verified buyer · Cyclist</span></span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  

  <section class="section section--raised" id="nurva-faq">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <div class="sec-head sec-head--center stack" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">Answers</span>
        <h2 class="h2">Questions, answered</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq" data-faq data-faq-single="true" data-reveal>
        <div class="faq__item" data-open="false">
          <h3><button class="faq__q" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Will it stay on while I train?</span><span class="faq__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3>
          <div class="faq__a"><div><p>Yes. Nurva uses a sweat-resistant medical-grade adhesive rated for up to 10 hours of wear, including high-output training and humid conditions. Apply to clean, dry skin — oils and moisturiser are the main reason any strip lifts early.</p></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__item" data-open="false">
          <h3><button class="faq__q" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Does it actually help with snoring?</span><span class="faq__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3>
          <div class="faq__a"><div><p>It helps when your snoring is driven by nasal congestion or a narrow nasal valve, which covers a large share of people. It is not a treatment for obstructive sleep apnoea. If you snore heavily, stop breathing in your sleep, or wake unrefreshed most mornings, please speak to a doctor.</p></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__item" data-open="false">
          <h3><button class="faq__q" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Is there anything in it? Drugs, menthol, medication?</span><span class="faq__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3>
          <div class="faq__a"><div><p>No. Nurva is a purely mechanical, drug-free external nasal dilator. Nothing is absorbed, inhaled or ingested — the strip simply lifts the sides of your nose open from the outside.</p></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__item" data-open="false">
          <h3><button class="faq__q" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What size should I get?</span><span class="faq__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3>
          <div class="faq__a"><div><p>One size fits most adult noses. If you have a smaller nose or you're buying for a teenager, place the strip slightly higher on the bridge for a comfortable fit.</p></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__item" data-open="false">
          <h3><button class="faq__q" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Can I reuse a strip?</span><span class="faq__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3>
          <div class="faq__a"><div><p>No — each strip is single use. The adhesive and the spring tension are designed to perform once, for up to 10 hours.</p></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__item" data-open="false">
          <h3><button class="faq__q" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Will it irritate sensitive skin?</span><span class="faq__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3>
          <div class="faq__a"><div><p>The adhesive is hypoallergenic and latex free. If your skin is very sensitive, remove the strip under warm water — the adhesive softens and releases without pulling.</p></div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq__item" data-open="false">
          <h3><button class="faq__q" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>How fast is shipping, and what if it doesn't work for me?</span><span class="faq__sign" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3>
          <div class="faq__a"><div><p>Orders ship within one business day with tracking. If Nurva doesn't make a difference for you, tell us within 30 nights and we'll refund you — you don't need to send the pack back.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta-band stack" data-reveal="scale">
        <span class="eyebrow">Join the movement</span>
        <h2 class="h1">Get 15% off your first pack</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-inline:auto">Training tips, breathing protocols and early access to new drops. No spam — unsubscribe any time.</p>

        <form class="signup" onsubmit="return false">
          <label class="visually-hidden" for="NewsletterEmail">Email</label>
          <input id="NewsletterEmail" type="email" placeholder="you@email.com" autocomplete="email" required>
          <button type="submit" class="btn">Get my code</button>
        </form>

        <p class="form-note">By subscribing you agree to receive marketing emails from Nurva.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
